ield-3}} |  |" :question/worked-solution "Notice that $B$ is the $2$nd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3}.$\n\nSince we're multiplying the $3\\times 3$ matrix $A$ by the $2$nd *column* of the identity matrix ${I}_{3},$ the result must be the $2$nd *column* of $A.$ Therefore,\n\n$$\nAB=\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix}.\n$$\n\nLet's check the long way:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5} & -5 & 2 \\\\ 3 & \\sqrt{5} & -6 \\\\ 7 & -8 & 0\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}\\sqrt{5}\\cdot 0+(-5)\\cdot 1+2\\cdot 0 \\\\ 3\\cdot 0+\\sqrt{5}\\cdot 1+(-6)\\cdot 0 \\\\ 7\\cdot 0+(-8)\\cdot 1+0\\cdot 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 \\\\ \\sqrt{5} \\\\ -8\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186311868 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "56ac8b17-7e11-562c-a2ac-7541b297f973" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309401}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "56ac8b17-7e11-562c-a2ac-7541b297f973" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309401} :answer-field/id #uuid "4597226b-1e40-5a57-9b8c-bc1cc3c255a1" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186310980} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "77e81909-6879-5cff-9653-ee1f5d1086cf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309689}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "77e81909-6879-5cff-9653-ee1f5d1086cf" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186309689} :answer-field/id #uuid "8a97cd18-d3ce-52af-ac4b-5edd53e4decb" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186311187} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "9edd27b9-5e64-5d54-bae7-8c5b80d490a9" 