-solution "We apply the distributive law\n\n$$\nAC+BC=(A+B)C.\n$$\n\nSo, we calculate $A+B$ first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A+B & =\\begin{bmatrix}7 & 6 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -4 & 2 \\\\ 0 & 5 & 4\\end{bmatrix}+\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & -6 & 1 \\\\ -3 & 8 & -2 \\\\ 0 & -5 & 0\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =4{I}_{3}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n \n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC+BC & =(A+B)C \\\\  & =4{I}_{3}C \\\\  & =4C \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}8\\sqrt{5} & -4 & 12 \\\\ 0 & 4\\sqrt{3} & 16 \\\\ -8 & 12 & 20\\text{ }\\end{bmatrix}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186299802 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c6d5cde5-f8df-5fc9-a0e0-c09bfdb02cd8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298421}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "c6d5cde5-f8df-5fc9-a0e0-c09bfdb02cd8" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298421} :answer-field/id #uuid "ccab8471-735f-5ae8-b673-5e8ed001726e" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299321} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1e95aa11-9c6c-5d9d-8704-093197ed80a2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\sqrt{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297686}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1e95aa11-9c6c-5d9d-8704-093197ed80a2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3\\sqrt{6}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186297686} :answer-field/id #uuid "de321768-bb62-5d1b-9d27-3e0f92c07001" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186299390} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8b9afeee-39ce-5ee9-bcbc-0847b2f4bcb6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "0" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186298157}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8b9afeee-39ce-5ee9-bcbc-0847b2f4bcb6